dates tied. Prediction markets nonetheless price Rounds as an overwhelming favorite, and every major race rater calls the race Safe or Solid Republican. Bengs' path runs through consolidating Democratic voters and winning over independents, a tall order in a state this red.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.0278, "margin": -11.24}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.0505, "margin": -11.0}]}